  "description": "BEYOND THE DISTANCE. The Revelator Syro is more than a road bike. It’s an invitation to keep riding. To take on the next climb. To choose the unknown road. And to turn every ride into a story worth telling. With its balanced combination of endurance comfort and aerodynamic performance, the Revelator Syro is your perfect companion for long adventures, spontaneous after-work rides, and ambitious challenges that have been on your bucket list for years. Its comfort-oriented geometry and slightly more upright riding position provide a relaxed riding experience, even after hours in the saddle – allowing you to focus on what truly matters: the journey. A standout feature is the FIS – Full Integrated Storage integrated into the downtube. Thanks to the practical ClickFix system, essentials such as a spare tube, CO₂ cartridge, or personal belongings are securely stored and always within easy reach. The FIS – Full Integrated Storage can be individually enhanced with specially designed accessories. A custom-fit storage bag and an integrated tool kit are available for all models through the KTM aftermarket range. And with frame sizes ranging from XXS to XXL, the Revelator Syro offers the perfect fit for almost every rider.",
